{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07875","headline":"陪张丞相登荆城楼因寄蓟州张使君及浪泊戍主刘家 · 孟浩然","name":"陪张丞相登荆城楼因寄蓟州张使君及浪泊戍主刘家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓟门天北畔，铜柱日南端。\n出守声弥远，投荒法未宽。\n侧身聊倚望，携手莫同欢。\n白璧无瑕玷，青松有岁寒。\n府中丞相阁，江上使君滩。\n兴尽回舟去，方知行路难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}